*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% CUPS PPD for the Jolimark FP-620K+ 24-pin dot-matrix printer.
*%
*% The rastertofp620kp filter converts CUPS raster data into the ESC/P2K
*% block-graphics commands used by the vendor's Windows driver.
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "FP620KP.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Jolimark"
*Product: "(FP-620K+)"
*ModelName: "Jolimark FP-620K+"
*ShortNickName: "Jolimark FP-620K+"
*NickName: "Jolimark FP-620K+ ESC/P2K"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertofp620kp"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Jolimark;CMD:ESC/P2K;MDL:FP-620K+;"

*% The filter understands two hidden job options for field calibration:
*%   -o fp620k-origin-x=<points>   left mechanical origin (default 24)
*%   -o fp620k-origin-y=<points>   top mechanical origin (default 11.6)

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "18 36 577 806"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "18 36 402 559"
*ImageableArea B5/B5: "18 36 498 693"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "18 36 594 756"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "18 36 594 972"
*ImageableArea Executive/Executive: "18 36 504 720"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension B5/B5: "516 729"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Executive/Executive: "522 756"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Output Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 360x180dpi
*Resolution 360x180dpi/360 x 180 dpi (sharp text, default): "<</HWResolution[360 180]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 180x180dpi/180 x 180 dpi (fast draft): "<</HWResolution[180 180]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 360x360dpi/360 x 360 dpi (interlaced, heavy): "<</HWResolution[360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *PrintDirection/Print Direction: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PrintDirection
*DefaultPrintDirection: Unidirectional
*PrintDirection Unidirectional/Quality (unidirectional): ""
*PrintDirection Bidirectional/Speed (bidirectional): ""
*CloseUI: *PrintDirection

*% Default to the internal font / no special options.
*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier/Courier: Standard

*OpenUI *InputSlot/Paper Source: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: Auto
*InputSlot Auto/Automatic: ""
*InputSlot Tractor/Tractor Feed: ""
*InputSlot Manual/Manual Feed: ""
*CloseUI: *InputSlot
